          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bima's working for 23-3x>2 ends with the number line shown. Compare it with the correct solution. Code 1 means it is correct, code 2 means the boundary circle is the only problem, code 3 means the direction of the line is the only problem, and code 4 means both are wrong. Enter the code."
        }
