            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Solve the inequality yourself first, paying attention to the step that divides by a negative number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Subtract 23 from both sides, divide both sides by -3, then compare both the circle and the direction with the drawing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dividing by -3 reverses the sign. The correct solution needs an open circle at 7 and a line going left."
            },
            {
              "type": "display_math",
              "latex": "23-3x>2\\Rightarrow -3x>-21\\Rightarrow x<7"
            }
          ],
          "mark_type": "M",
          "mark_value": 2
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The drawing has a filled circle and a line going right, so both are wrong: code 4."
            },
